      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Semi detached three bedroom house.\r\nBenefitting from side access leading to a south west facing rear garden.\r\nSituated within a large residential development with well maintained communal green areas.\r\nLocated convenient to all amenities in Navan town centre.\r\nThe N51 and M3 nearby offer ease of access to Dublin city centre and further afield.\r\nExtending to approximately 100 sq. m (1,076 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a three bedroom house with gardens to the front and rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 100 sq. m (1,076 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
      },
